  title: King is Pregnant
  description: Oh no, the King is pregnant - but the child is a bastard! This could
    ruin the rule of the King, but disposing of this will cost a lot of money...
  isKingEvent: 1
  choices:
  - choiceText: 'Order the head doctor to do something about this. '
    consequences:
    - type: 0
      amount: -10
  - choiceText: 'Go to the weird witch in the woods and hope her potions help. '
    consequences:
    - type: 1
      amount: -5
  - choiceText: 'Birth the child in secret, and pin it on some soldier - he will
      be hanged. Possibly some others too. '
    consequences:
    - type: 2
      amount: -5
